  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Resume-summarization now preserves the active scene (populates AiSceneResponse.SceneName, DefaultSummarizer includes it in the prompt) and honors ISummarizer.ShouldSummarize, CharacterThreshold, and SceneRequestSettings.EnableSummarization. Long-term memory re-synthesis now reuses the previously loaded ConversationMemory for incremental updates. EndpointHttpTool builds URLs safely from numeric/boolean arguments (no more crash on non-string JSON). Scene routing function names are normalized for LLM provider compliance and resolved by both raw and normalized name.",
